#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:5
#: 456a85994fa249b0adb3811aed67e073
msgid "Mission Planner Flight PLAN"
msgstr "Mission Planner 飞行规划"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:7
#: fe543d698be54327b9cf6c4328d59feb
msgid ""
"This section covers what you see and what you can do when in the Flight PLAN"
" screen of Mission Planner - selected in the menu at the top of the Mission "
"Planner application.  This section provides for planning and executing "
"flight plans - called missions."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在 Mission Planner "
"应用程序顶部菜单中选择飞行规划（PLAN）界面后所看到的内容及可用操作。本节提供飞行计划（即任务）的规划与执行功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:13
#: 5e2ad6a21ac6473eacf893019ddd9aec
msgid "The Flight PLAN Screen"
msgstr "飞行规划界面"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:18
#: 22ad3dcbd99a45379fc1cc79ca471dc7
msgid ""
"**Upper left corner**: Displays the distance from HOME, the heading and "
"distance from the last entered waypoint (HOME if one does not exist), and "
"total mission trip distance"
msgstr "**左上角**：显示距 HOME 的距离、与最后输入航点的方向及距离（若无航点则为 HOME），以及任务总飞行距离"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:19
#: 6e76d2b3227c45c58c7a37defecd94da
msgid ""
"**Right side**: Displays the Waypoints list for the mission. See "
":ref:`common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events` for more details."
" Above this you can set the WPradius, Loiter Radius,and default altitude for"
" waypoints. Altitudes can be entered in Relative (above HOME "
"altitude),Absolute (ASL), and above Terrain. Units are set in the "
"CONFIG/Planner page."
msgstr ""
"**右侧**：显示任务的航点列表。更多详情请参阅 :ref:`common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events`。在其上方可设置航点半径、盘旋半径和默认航点高度。高度可以相对高度（相对于 HOME "
"高度）、绝对高度（海拔）和地形高度方式输入。单位在「CONFIG/Planner」页面中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:20
#: 8282850138fa4521af683f7d33883af7
msgid ""
"**Bottom** :At the bottom of the planner view you will see the latitude and "
"longitude of the mouse cursor, its ASL (from SRTM, ie Terrain, data). You "
"can select different map providers, Load or Save waypoints files, Read or "
"Write the mission to the autopilot. In addition, the details of the HOME "
"position on the map is shown."
msgstr ""
"**底部**：在规划视图底部，可看到鼠标光标的纬度和经度，以及其 ASL（来自 SRTM "
"地形数据）。可选择不同的地图提供商，加载或保存航点文件，向飞控读取或写入任务。此外，还会显示地图上 HOME 位置的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:22
#: 8435f21e60744348a846cc7fadfa00ef
msgid "Any left mouse click adds a waypoint to the mission."
msgstr "鼠标左键单击任意位置即可向任务中添加一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:25
#: 5ed0ad0be6664f359de1ecac8932cea7
msgid "Right Click Menu"
msgstr "右键菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:27
#: 19ae25bd97534690afefcdb66bb79924
msgid "Many options are available with a right mouse click:"
msgstr "右键单击可使用多种选项："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:31
#: 1d57afe0e854405c8cff07129adc19f9
msgid ""
"Delete WP: left click a waypoint, Ineright click and select this, deletes "
"it."
msgstr "删除航点：左键单击选中航点后，右键单击并选择此项即可删除。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:32
#: e9474202831e416a9e60597dfddd48fd
msgid ""
"Insert WP: adds a waypoint to the mission list at the current vehicle "
"location"
msgstr "插入航点：在当前飞行器位置向任务列表中插入一个航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:33
#: b235f55605d548dd86067a6d991688dc
msgid ""
"Insets Spline WP: Inserts a spline waypoint at current mouse position into "
"the mission list. See `here "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`_ for more info on "
"spline paths. (valid only for Copter, will insert normal waypoint in other "
"vehicles)"
msgstr ""
"插入样条航点：在当前鼠标位置向任务列表中插入一个样条航点。有关样条路径的更多信息，请参阅 `此处 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`_。（仅对 Copter "
"有效，在其他飞行器上将插入普通航点）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:34
#: e7652843866b4ca0ae79afadc7e05122
msgid "Loiter: Adds a Loiter waypoint to the mission at the cursor"
msgstr "Loiter：在光标处向任务中添加一个 Loiter 航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:35
#: 9c39a3a06f414a228ec2b6a6ba8a9877
msgid "Jump: Adds a JUMP command to the mission"
msgstr "跳转：向任务中添加一条 JUMP 命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:36
#: be59dba4b4a0471ca74323c5ecc3a2cf
msgid "RTL: Adds an RTL to the mission at the cursor"
msgstr "RTL：在光标处向任务中添加 RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:37
#: 2d62552bbe9a4cc79f36b4b3f836e79d
msgid "Land: Adds a Land point to the mission at the cursor"
msgstr "降落：在光标处向任务中添加降落点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:38
#: 82f06e27bf2a479492c2b4166c62a633
msgid "Takeoff: Adds a TAKEOFF point to the mission at the cursor"
msgstr "起飞：在光标处向任务中添加 TAKEOFF 点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:39
#: cfcf4cca58704511ad48f01b1f5e11bd
msgid "DO_SET_ROI: Adds a SET_ROI mission command"
msgstr "DO_SET_ROI：添加一条 SET_ROI 任务命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:40
#: f9fac2dbbc2c471ea4d9d8a426c25a4c
msgid ""
"Clear Mission: Clears the displayed mission, but only in the workspace, not "
"the autopilot. To clear the autopilot mission, WRITE a cleared workspace to "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "清除任务：清除工作区中显示的任务，但不会清除飞控中的任务。若要清除飞控中的任务，需将已清空的工作区写入飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:43
#: 23cce8b86d42494e8f9ad656b58aab8a
msgid "Advanced Mission Creation Tools"
msgstr "高级任务创建工具"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:45
#: eab621eb781a43dfaae215faabad1da9
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has the ability to auto-generate numerous survey and grid "
"type missions. Most are based on a drawn polygon on the map."
msgstr "Mission Planner 具备自动生成多种航测及网格型任务的能力，大多数基于在地图上绘制的多边形区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:55
#: e8b1dd2be6594c989bf9c08506d50a77
msgid "Polygon:"
msgstr "多边形："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:50
#: 699e744fe3a94ac4b3511edb686b74a5
msgid ""
"Draw a Polygon: Clicking this starts drawing a polygon between mouse clicks."
msgstr "绘制多边形：点击后开始在鼠标单击位置之间绘制多边形。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:51
#: c4ed8342f43e422bb5a754fda97d29ef
msgid "Clear Polygon: Clears the displayed polygon"
msgstr "清除多边形：清除已显示的多边形"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:52
#: 8dbb6df94d504619bf04d561b00c4cf8
msgid "Save Polygon: Save points to a file"
msgstr "保存多边形：将多边形点保存到文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:53
#: 04bf1d5727234af284d3d97f7e3d15c6
msgid "Load Polygon: Load polygon points from a file"
msgstr "加载多边形：从文件加载多边形点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:54
#: 03001eb5d74b4f28b2d21f3b999e0130
msgid "From SHP: Load polygon shape from a .shp file"
msgstr "从 SHP 加载：从 .shp 文件加载多边形形状"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:55
#: 01b0e0b7feb44e149d7ad870caeb7d72
msgid "Area: Displays area of drawn polygon"
msgstr "面积：显示已绘制多边形的面积"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:57
#: 84dddf89a2db401ca4f4ff81fcad2369
msgid ""
"Once drawn, many different surveys,fences, or waypoint grids can be "
"generated with:"
msgstr "绘制完成后，可生成多种航测、围栏或航点网格："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:59
#: 4e5a8338229a48208f7e9965164e6a63
msgid ""
"GeoFence (Plane only): Plane uses a different method for loading and reading"
" its GeoFence to/from the autopilot, than Copter and Rover use, so this "
"submenu is provided. See below, under Fence Creation, for details."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏（仅限 Plane）：Plane 使用与 Copter 和 Rover "
"不同的方式向飞控加载和读取地理围栏，因此提供此子菜单。详情请参阅下文「围栏创建」部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:61
#: c6b4135c58c94915b8beea325bbbbf62
msgid ""
"Rally Points (Plane only): Plane uses a different method for loading and "
"reading its Rally points to/from the autopilot, than Copter and Rover use, "
"so this submenu is provided. See below, under Rally Points Creation, for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"集结点（仅限 Plane）：Plane 使用与 Copter 和 Rover "
"不同的方式向飞控加载和读取集结点，因此提供此子菜单。详情请参阅下文「集结点创建」部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:72
#: dc9f87fd39714714a7e269443452bdc8
msgid "Auto WP:"
msgstr "Auto WP（自动航点）："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:64
#: 1a941bed1c494141828c03aa63e1c45f
msgid "Create WP Circle: Creates a circle of waypoints"
msgstr "创建航点圆：创建一圈圆形排列的航点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:65
#: 45f2232aacda418fa5a32fd9dae7a769
msgid "Create Spline WP Circle: Creates a circle of spline waypoints."
msgstr "创建样条航点圆：创建一圈圆形排列的样条航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:66
#: 5d13fb3888654f90863c6f4958084d57
msgid "Area:Displays area of polygon"
msgstr "面积：显示多边形面积"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:67
#: 9e4af3bf51ec4f9a8c5ae33b037a28fd
msgid "Text:(in development)"
msgstr "文字：（开发中）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:68
#: 4f9d52aebf7143b694b8f86197d2ed41
msgid ""
"Create Circle Survey: Creates a circular survey. A survey is a set of spaced"
" waypoints designed to allow a camera to take overlapping photos of the "
"survey area. This does not require a drawn polygon."
msgstr "创建环形航测：创建环形航测任务。航测是一组间隔排列的航点，用于让摄像头对航测区域进行重叠拍摄。此功能不需要预先绘制多边形。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:69
#: 942b382ea9374ab58915b8169055f953
msgid "Survey (Grid): Creates a survey mission based on drawn polygon."
msgstr "航测（网格）：基于已绘制的多边形创建航测任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:70
#: 95e7a812eaa54d88abe12fa05f24d75d
msgid "Face Map: (in development)"
msgstr "面部地图：（开发中）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:71
#: 7355cf68079e49bda113f9a2be09ed6e
msgid ""
"Survey(Gridv2): Creates a box survey mission with a different user "
"interface. No pre-drawn polygon required."
msgstr "航测（网格 v2）：使用不同用户界面创建矩形航测任务，无需预先绘制多边形。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:72
#: 5aa234391ff64367b2d0db74e13d1d9e
msgid ""
"Simple Grid: Creates a simple grid of waypoints within the drawn polygon."
msgstr "简单网格：在已绘制的多边形范围内创建简单的航点网格。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:74
#: 8ea5f6bed5e449c3bd0294febd428f91
msgid ""
"Map Tools: Provides several map tools for measuring distances, pre-fetching "
"map areas for off line use in the field, the ability to plot the mission "
"altitude vs terrain, etc."
msgstr "地图工具：提供多种地图工具，用于测量距离、预下载地图区域以供野外离线使用、绘制任务高度与地形的对比图等。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:76
#: 8a02291dfd7e446584076db15cd8bce8
msgid "File Load and Save: Load and Save waypoint, KML, and SHP files"
msgstr "文件加载与保存：加载和保存航点、KML 及 SHP 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:78
#: c5e67a7a29224f7ca380ce0c4ede3748
msgid ""
"POI: This provides a means to create map markers for points of interest. "
"This allows an easy method to be able to point the camera or fly to points "
"of interest on the map. You can add, delete,save them to a file or load them"
" from a file you have created. They will appear on the map."
msgstr ""
"兴趣点（POI）：提供在地图上为兴趣点创建标记的功能，便于将摄像头指向或飞往地图上的兴趣点。可添加、删除、保存到文件或从已创建的文件加载，这些点将显示在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:80
#: 3fbcb244e14e439fa373b5a985fc2926
msgid "Tracker Home: Set or retrieve an Antenna Trackers HOME position."
msgstr "天线追踪器 Home：设置或获取天线追踪器的 HOME 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:82
#: 2eb2dd28801a40a9942aabca00357609
msgid "Modify Alt: Quickly change all mission altitudes."
msgstr "修改高度：快速更改所有任务航点的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:84
#: 4be06ae37266469c93bde18576d0b68a
msgid ""
"Enter UTM Coord: Sets your current location to a UTM location in the absence"
" of GPS lock"
msgstr "输入 UTM 坐标：在无 GPS 锁定的情况下，将当前位置设置为指定的 UTM 坐标"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:86
#: 5785b6f0576d4b6898cf9c078b7b746c
msgid "Set Home Here: Sets the HOME position at current cursor location."
msgstr "在此设置 Home：将 HOME 位置设置在当前光标所在位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:88
#: a62a759095084bd78ed56b2329d94169
msgid "Fix mission top/bottom: experimental"
msgstr "修正任务顶部/底部：实验性功能"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:91
#: 534c87f1bcab4f27b5bae278e3c5b77d
msgid "Mission Planning Details"
msgstr "任务规划详情"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:93
#: 2112c036751545688551587b839dcabc
msgid "Here is where you will find the details for mission planning:"
msgstr "以下是任务规划的详细信息："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:95
#: 709b99f3dcc34af9800489b8e2da60e2
msgid ""
":ref:`Planning a Mission with Way points and Events <common-planning-a-"
"mission-with-waypoints-and-events>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`规划含航点与事件的任务 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:96
#: c28a5a8ee5564003be49b7c08477284f
msgid ""
":ref:`Using Python Scripts in Mission Planner <using-python-scripts-in-"
"mission-planner>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`在 Mission Planner 中使用 Python 脚本 <using-python-scripts-in-mission-"
"planner>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:99
#: e177fd8eeba54f90a9e35ea06720075f
msgid "FENCES Creation"
msgstr "围栏创建"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:101
#: acc6be134cb240dfa90dd7f58a7c607c
msgid ""
"In the upper right of the map panel is a drop-down box, normally showing "
"MISSION. If the FENCES option, is selected, then instead of mission/waypoint"
" planning, fence creation is enabled."
msgstr "地图面板右上角有一个下拉框，通常显示「MISSION」。选择「FENCES」选项后，将启用围栏创建功能，而非任务/航点规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:103
#: 3b716298a7e54e9f88a40cedf070b4e5
msgid ""
"Fences can be circular, or polygons. In Plane only polygon fences are "
"allowed. In Copter and Rover,  circular and polygon, or both superimposed, "
"are possible. Also, exclusion zones (normally a fence is an inclusion zone),"
" are possible."
msgstr ""
"围栏可以是圆形或多边形。Plane 仅支持多边形围栏；Copter 和 Rover 支持圆形、多边形，或二者叠加，同时还支持排除区（通常围栏为包含区）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:105
#: 22442a1fad654ebba0bdd33d7946827c
msgid "For Plane, the right click menu item, has the GeoFence sub-menu:"
msgstr "对于 Plane，右键菜单项包含地理围栏子菜单："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:111
#: 3ba09c4844264a45ae2d6fb8addba093
msgid "Geo-Fence:"
msgstr "地理围栏："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:113
#: f41894974999475e90cc48dbb21f0e43
msgid "Upload: Upload a fence based on drawn polygon"
msgstr "上传：根据已绘制的多边形上传围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:114
#: 7889114809ae4edb9e340154cb23dbc0
msgid "Download: Retrieve fence from autopilot"
msgstr "下载：从飞控获取围栏数据"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:115
#: 9b205fe0ce454298abdc5703b3fc2253
msgid ""
"Set Return Location: Plane fences require a return location. See "
":ref:`geofencing`."
msgstr "设置返航位置：Plane 围栏需要设置返航位置。请参阅 :ref:`geofencing`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:116
#: 8914a1f7c07f4b7e855a86993c03ee0c
msgid "Load from File: Load a geo-fence from a file"
msgstr "从文件加载：从文件加载地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:117
#: 95c9d8b8d6144dc7b49f2d8c7d4d93a3
msgid "Save to File: Save the geo-fence points and return point to a file"
msgstr "保存到文件：将地理围栏点和返航点保存到文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:118
#: f15dc397d9a9425a8158d0a648cf7fad
msgid ""
"Clear: Clear the geo-fence on the map. This **does clear** the fence in the "
"autopilot as well as the map workspace."
msgstr "清除：清除地图上的地理围栏。此操作**同时会清除**飞控中的围栏以及地图工作区中的围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:120
#: a4d8a5b145b04f81bc96a31dbc752729
msgid ""
"For Copter and Rover, the polygon drawing icon in the upper left of the "
"screen is used to create fences."
msgstr "对于 Copter 和 Rover，使用屏幕左上角的多边形绘制图标来创建围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:125
#: 0149d83b3ddd4669ad5902d52c8396b1
msgid ""
"This is an expanded version of the Polygon tools in the right click menu."
msgstr "这是右键菜单中多边形工具的扩展版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:127
#: 3a89e4ffe85b43c8a1988b18f7aea905
msgid ""
"To create a polygon fence, select \"Draw a Polygon\", and left click the "
"points desired. Then select \"Fence Inclusion\". You will see a list of "
"items in the mission list area. These are fence items and can be loaded to "
"the autopilot with the \"Write\" button below, like waypoint lists were. "
"Similarly, they can be read from the autopilot, saved or loaded from a file."
msgstr ""
"要创建多边形围栏，请选择「Draw a Polygon」并左键单击所需各点，然后选择「Fence "
"Inclusion」。任务列表区域将显示一系列条目，这些即为围栏条目，可通过下方的「Write」按钮写入飞控，方式与航点列表相同。同样，也可从飞控读取，或从文件保存与加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:129
#: f190ca2cb47f435a960763fb68d5e87a
msgid ""
"To create a circular fence, simply left click. An item will be placed in the"
" mission list. You can adjust the radius of the zone. This may be either an "
"inclusion zone, where flight is allowed, or an exclusion zone, where flight "
"will be prevented."
msgstr "要创建圆形围栏，直接左键单击即可。任务列表中将新增一个条目，可调整区域半径。该区域可设置为允许飞行的包含区，也可设置为禁止飞行的排除区。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:131
#: 7835a136928f4e34a9619ce9edc93dfd
msgid ""
"These circular zones may only be shown as blue markers in the PLAN and DATA "
"view at certain zoom levels."
msgstr "在特定缩放级别下，这些圆形区域在 PLAN 和 DATA 视图中可能仅显示为蓝色标记。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:133
#: 4c6557d513644e76a7aff808fdab43d6
msgid ""
"In Copter, various parameters of the fences can be set in the "
"CONFIG/GeoFence screen. You can have different types of geo-fences loaded in"
" the autopilot, but elect only to use combinations or altitude, circular, "
"and/or polygon fences loaded by selecting the \"Type\" on this page. For "
"Rover, these parameters must be set manually in the CONFIG/Full Parameter "
"List screen"
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 中，可在 CONFIG/GeoFence "
"页面设置围栏的各项参数。飞控中可加载多种类型的地理围栏，但可通过该页面上的「Type」选项，选择仅启用高度围栏、圆形围栏和/或多边形围栏的组合。对于 "
"Rover，这些参数必须在 CONFIG/Full Parameter List 页面手动设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:136
#: 44544b94523d45b4b17dac1c3c99b67f
msgid "Rally Points Creation"
msgstr "集结点创建"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:138
#: fb80515a83bb4846b88624ca3d5bd7fc
msgid ""
"The third option in the MISSION/FENCES/RALLY drop-down box, RALLY, allows "
"creation of a RALLY points list. For use of RALLY points, see :ref:`common-"
"rally-points`."
msgstr ""
"MISSION/FENCES/RALLY 下拉框中的第三个选项 RALLY，用于创建集结点列表。有关集结点的使用方法，请参见 :ref:`common-"
"rally-points`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:140
#: 2c25dcbb540c405cade4c6fd4db8c1c6
msgid ""
"Left clicking will create a Rally Point at the cursor, and it will appear in"
" the mission list to the right. Just like waypoints, these can be written to"
" and read from, the autopilot, as well as being saved or loaded to/from a "
"file using the \"Read\", \"Write\", \"Load File\", and \"Save File\" "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"左键单击将在光标处创建一个集结点，并显示在右侧任务列表中。与航点一样，可使用「Read」、「Write」、「Load File」和「Save "
"File」按钮将其写入或读取飞控，以及保存或加载到文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:142
#: 47be0d6de5a747939cbc065472601801
msgid "In Plane only, saving and loading, is done from  the right-click menu:"
msgstr "仅在 Plane 中，保存和加载操作通过右键菜单完成："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:146
#: d7528a57eb25417996a1193df62731fa
msgid "Rally Points:"
msgstr "集结点："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:148
#: cf39e420990045b2b6c4bdddbdf838f3
msgid "Set Rally Point: Create rally point at cursor location"
msgstr "Set Rally Point：在光标位置创建集结点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:149
#: 05c57d5593414a57803c47ca45a5f6d6
msgid "Download: Retrieve rally points from autopilot"
msgstr "Download：从飞控读取集结点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:150
#: 7f858bde890847daa6ab2016bd5f771d
msgid "Upload: Save rally points to autopilot"
msgstr "Upload：将集结点保存到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:151
#: 58c9f11e743b49d99df475de7304469b
msgid ""
"Clear Rally Points: Clear the rally points. This **does clear** the points "
"in the autopilot as well as the map workspace."
msgstr "Clear Rally Points：清除集结点。此操作**同时清除**飞控和地图工作区中的集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:152
#: 574a9b75926b413f8c53b0ecd937e85f
msgid "Save Rally to File: Save the rally points to a file"
msgstr "Save Rally to File：将集结点保存到文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:153
#: dbf7425da7644f369bd11eddd533894c
msgid "Load Rally from File: Load the rally points from a file"
msgstr "Load Rally from File：从文件加载集结点"
